WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.440
Let's have lunch.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.100
Okay.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.230
He slept all the way through fourth period...

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.530
He's awake.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.970
Oh, time for lunch.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.000
Don't give me that!

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.610
You knew I was your classmate, didn't you?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.870
Huh? Yeah.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.250
You should've told me sooner.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.690
Is that a yokai?

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.840
I can totally see them now.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.710
You're not going to exorcise it?

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.760
I only exorcise yokai I'm hired to exorcise.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.130
If I exorcised every yokai 
I saw, I wouldn't last long.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:42.730
But you said yokai belong in the Underworld.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.910
Won't he be stuck wandering here 
forever if we just ignore him?

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.800
Ignore any yokai you see.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.920
I hired you,

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.240
so you only need to do the jobs I give you.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.740
On that note, go buy me some 
tea and cod roe rice balls.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.490
<i>What am I, your errand boy?</i>

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.010
<i>Why do I have to do this?</i>

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.720
<b>Mystery 2: The Ant</b>

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:39.510
<i>But I'm doing this to pay off my debt.</i>

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.010
<i>No way...</i>

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.690
It might be faster to run 
to the convenience store.

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.850
What's wrong? Do you feel sick?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.000
My leg suddenly went numb.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.110
I can't move it.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.190
Did you twist it or anything?

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.370
No. It hurts...

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.670
<i>Ignore any yokai you see.</i>

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.840
Hey, what's wrong?

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.560
She can't move her leg.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.640
Seriously? We should call an ambulance!

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.630
<i>Damn it. I can't ignore this!</i>

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.260
Huh? I can move it.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.640
Is it better?

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.160
You should be okay now,

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:28.670
but stop by the nurse's office just in case.

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.720
Huh? Uh, thanks...

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:31.520
What happened?

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:34.990
Her foot healed when he 
held his hand over it.

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.920
Seriously? He must have ESP!

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.780
He's got ESP! He's an ESPer!

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:39.780
I'm not an ESPer!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.050
<i>I want nothing to do with yokai,</i>

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:47.560
<i>but it's hard to ignore them...</i>

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.950
<i>What is this chill I feel?</i>

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.440
<i>I felt something similar</i>

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.550
<i>when the fuzzball possessed me...</i>

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.660
<i>But that was nothing compared to this.</i>

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.140
<i>It's terrifying.</i>

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.550
What is this sound?

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.860
<i>Am I the only one who can hear it?</i>

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.440
Huh?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.460
<i>He's late.</i>

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.690
What's going on?

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:26.700
Is it him?

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.410
That's loud. What's going on?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.080
Abeno-kun.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:35.580
Abeno-san!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.200
Did I not warn you ten minutes ago

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.990
to ignore them?!

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:48.160
I hired you to make my 
job easier, not harder!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.720
I'm sorry!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.530
Unbelievable!

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.980
How could you let these 
pesky things possess you?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.080
Move.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.200
Uh, okay.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.400
Mononokean, come.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.620
Abeno-san! Ow!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.460
You're choking me!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.710
Damn it!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.440
My neck!

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.460
Suck it up!

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:21.460
Ashiya, get the tips of your 
fingers inside the door!

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.470
Inside the door?

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.140
They backed off!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.260
Get inside while you can.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.190
Huh? This place...

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.820
It's the tea room from yesterday.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.750
Wait, huh?

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.300
I'm closing the door. Get inside.

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.890
That was close.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.310
"That was close," my ass!

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.960
If you leave, they'll chase you again.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:06.300
What? But I'm finally enjoying 
a normal high school life!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.770
Take off your shoes.

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:08.590
Huh?

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:12.220
I know! Summon that sliding door again!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.460
If you send the yokai through there...

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:15.450
I can't.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.600
Why not?

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:21.860
I'm only strong enough to open the 
door to the Underworld twice a day.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.140
So there's nothing we can do?

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:28.360
It'd take days to exorcise all those things.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.860
I wouldn't last.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.620
Are those things going to 
chase me my whole life?

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.650
It's not as though there's nothing we can do.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.380
What? You mean there's a way?

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:45.130
They're too strong, considering 
how small they are.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:48.630
They're probably young ones, 
sort of like worker ants.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.560
So there's a "queen ant" controlling them?

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:55.060
They were probably trying to 
take you to their boss's nest...

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.210
as prey.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.020
Prey?!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.780
This is just a guess.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:04.270
We won't know what the yokai 
actually wants until we meet it.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.650
You stay here.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.670
I'm the one who loses

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:11.360
if you're eaten before you pay off your debt.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.970
Hey, wait!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.180
What? If you want lunch, you'll have to wait.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.500
No, that's not it.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:22.860
Are you going to find and 
exorcise the boss yokai?

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.420
You'll never be able to 
leave this room if I don't.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.940
You don't need to exorcise it.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:32.240
What? If I don't, you can't go to school.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.620
But if the yokai ate you

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.530
because I asked you to help me,

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.120
I definitely wouldn't be 
able to come to school!

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.690
<i>He's terrified...</i>

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.580
<i>No, I guess being afraid like 
this is the normal reaction.</i>

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.060
<i>He's not like me.</i>

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.450
Abeno-san?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.940
I've been doing this for years.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:57.830
You don't need to worry about me.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.330
I'm not like you.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.340
I'll come get you once I've exorcised it.

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.490
Just so you know, this'll add to your debt.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.540
Wait! I'll go with you.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.470
You'd only be yokai bait if you came.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.970
I <i>want </i>to be bait.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.380
What?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:19.440
If I act as bait and go to the yokai's nest,

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.580
I may be able to find their boss.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.520
How can you say that when you've 
been shaking this whole time?

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.980
I'm freaking terrified!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.360
Well, then...

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:31.680
But it's not as if you're not scared, right?

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.510
Me?

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.140
Of course you're scared.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:38.240
Aside from the fact that you're a 
professional exorcist, you're just like me.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.850
We're in the same grade,

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.950
and your build's not that 
different from mine.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.250
We can both see yokai.

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:48.380
We have more similarities than differences.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:52.380
Besides, this happened because I was careless,

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.620
so I should fix it myself.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:56.760
I've been relying on you too much.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.160
I'll do my best!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.640
You're hardly convincing.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:05.980
Well, fine. This is your first job.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.770
Be good bait.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:09.400
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.280
You can let them nibble on you a little.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.430
What?!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.900
<b>Authorized Personnel Only</b>

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:35.050
<b>The Morose Mononokean</b>

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.380
There're even more than this afternoon.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.890
They're looking at me!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:49.820
Go on, Ashiya.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.530
Don't push me!

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.950
What? You said you'd be bait.

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.200
I'll go when I'm good and ready!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.190
And you'd better save me 
before they actually attack!

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.490
Yeah, sure, whatever.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.160
Show me some motivation!

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.650
If I get eaten,

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.440
I'm going to turn into a yokai and curse you!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.670
I'd exorcise you immediately.

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:17.630
Hey.

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.050
I'm going right now!

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.600
Take this.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.810
Hang it around your neck.

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:25.770
What is this?

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:29.770
So the yokai won't attack 
me if I'm wearing this?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.760
It doesn't do that at all.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:32.440
Huh?!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:35.210
I won't care much if you're eaten.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:35.690
Harsh!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.950
But I can't let anything eat that.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.410
You can't...

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:47.280
"I'll definitely come rescue you 
before you're eaten. Trust me."

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.370
Is that what you mean? 
Are you trying to be cool?

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.210
What?

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.210
You're annoying!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.670
A-Abeno-san!

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:56.700
Crap.

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:14.060
Unbelievable.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.900
They brought this human child.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.190
I suppose I have no choice.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.600
It's gonna eat me!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.920
Where's Abeno-san?

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.070
Abeno-san!

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:32.600
They ate him first!

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.210
Get off!

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.270
You're alive...

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:39.020
Wait, how could you 
let yourself get caught?!

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.820
I thought these yokai were after you.

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:42.840
Don't ask me!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.090
Anyway, up! Look up!

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:47.100
Human children.

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:52.170
You can see us?

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.110
You can hear our voices?

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.140
You're the leader of these little yokai?

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:04.740
Indeed. They brought me some 
rather unusual humans.

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:08.030
If you can see yokai,

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:10.620
have you ever heard of a particular one?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:15.640
One who runs a business that 
sends yokai to the Underworld.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:18.630
A yokai who calls himself the 
Master of the Mononokean.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.880
<i>What? Yokai?</i>

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:26.020
<i>Master of the Mononokean... and a yokai?</i>

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.890
Do you have a favor to ask of 
the Master of the Mononokean?

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.940
There's no point in telling 
a human such as yourself.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:41.020
Mononokean master, Abeno Haruitsuki,

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:43.430
requesting a portal to the Underworld.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.520
Right now, I'm the master.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.430
Tell me what you want.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.580
I'm surprised.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.920
I wasn't expecting a human master.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:03.600
I feel uneasy asking a human for help,

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.680
but if you're the master...

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:10.680
Will you send us to the Underworld?

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.680
Fine, but you...

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.690
I know. Send the little ones first.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.830
You can send me last.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.720
Hey, I found another one here.

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:30.700
There's more?

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:35.180
Big Boss Scree, are there any others?

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.790
Scree!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.920
Don't call me by that strange name.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.710
I sense no more little ones.

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:43.670
Okay, that's the last of them.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.580
We're finally finished.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:52.440
That just leaves Big Boss Scree.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.150
Oh, you didn't understand?

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:57.980
What?

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.730
Huh? Why did you close it?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:03.610
The Big Boss is still—

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:07.990
Child, look closely at my body.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.620
Huh? What's wrong with it?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.610
I've spread my roots in this world.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.750
I can't leave it anymore.

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:18.000
What? Roots?

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.500
Those roots are known as a "parasite shrub."

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.340
It attaches itself to yokai so they can't move

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.250
and drains their strength in order to grow.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.790
In the Underworld, they call it a curse.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:32.280
Here, we call it an incurable disease.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:34.300
I've long thought of sending

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:37.370
the little ones back to the 
Underworld before I wither away.

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:42.020
I felt it was my final
responsibility as their parent.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.450
I am grateful to you for granting my wish.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:49.030
Now I can die in peace.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:52.480
Do the little ones know about this?

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:56.160
No. I didn't want to worry them.

00:14:58.820 --> 00:14:59.800
Then...

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:03.540
I'll send you to the Underworld, 
even if it means cutting all your roots!

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:05.560
Huh? What?!

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.030
They're not like normal tree roots!

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.730
They grow back right away—

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:12.840
Then I'll find another way, 
no matter how long it takes!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.290
<i>He was so afraid before.</i>

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.600
<i>Why is he so motivated now?</i>

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.980
Disappearing without a word is cowardly.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.560
The little ones are waiting 
for you in the Underworld.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.570
The farewell you wanted

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.360
can't possibly be the farewell 
those little ones want.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:33.700
You speak as if you understand me, boy.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:38.080
Watching the little ones grow 
gave me a reason to live.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.830
I would have been willing 
to tear my body in half

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.480
so I could go to the Underworld with them.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:50.520
But, although I cannot protect my little ones,

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.830
I can at least send them to the Underworld.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.450
If I could have one wish,

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:58.590
it would be to watch over them until the day

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:02.810
they're big enough to take care of themselves.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.650
Though that's a hope I must abandon now.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:09.240
But...

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.090
Abeno-san?

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:20.160
If you're determined to reach the 
Underworld, no matter what it takes,

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:23.220
there is a way.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:26.920
What is that?

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:32.160
Swallowing this medicine will 
temporarily weaken the parasite shrub.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.370
What? You should've said 
you had that to begin with!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:39.120
But it will cause tremendous pain.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.310
Pain so great, some have died from it.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.660
Do you still want to take it?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:53.190
Is it possible?

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:58.460
Until the day this body withers, 
I want to be with them.

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:01.700
I don't want to be apart.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:05.530
Lord Abeno, Mononokean Master,

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:08.040
send me to the Underworld!

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.180
If that's what you wish...

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.110
It burns!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.400
It's much smaller now.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.080
Partially due to the medicine's effects,

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:23.160
but also because the anxiety that 
made it grow large decreased.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:24.840
<i>Now...</i>

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:30.010
<i>Whether or not it wakes up depends 
on how strong this yokai is.</i>

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.130
Big Boss Scree!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.440
Thank goodness you're alive!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.620
Ow! It hurts!

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:39.260
You idiot, Ashiya! What are you doing?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.250
Are you stupid, boy?

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:40.930
S-Sorry!

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:45.930
<i>It's strong enough to scream. Amazing.</i>

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.470
I apologize for the inconvenience.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.410
The little ones are waiting.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.480
I should go now.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.660
Can you move?

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.510
I'll take my time getting there.

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:03.900
Looks like they didn't wait.

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.440
They're here to get you.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.000
Unbelievable.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:22.100
I'm glad I didn't give up.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:29.110
I am truly grateful to you 
for granting my wish.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:32.940
I'll tell the whole Underworld about you.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.610
Don't bother! I don't need more work!

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:41.610
I've done nothing to deserve your gratitude.

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:46.200
I could only rely on the 
medicine and your strength.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.950
This was the only way I could

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.120
exorcise you as a Master
of the Mononokean.

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.750
I'm terribly sorry.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:55.720
Master, I'm the one who asked you to do this.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:58.570
So don't make that face.

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:03.640
Come, little ones. It's time to go.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.820
Wait! Big Boss Scree, I owe you an apology.

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.560
Sorry I acted like I understood you.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.970
Sorry I threatened to chop off your roots.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:15.560
Sorry for making you suffer. And...

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:14.410
Hey.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:16.730
That's enough!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:17.510
And...

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:21.270
For saying you were being a coward...

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:23.660
I can't apologize for that.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.320
I'm sorry.

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:32.970
Thanks to you, I avoided becoming a coward.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:37.900
Oh, right.

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:41.400
There's an apothecary in the 
Underworld called the "Kiyakudo."

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.630
The master's a strange one,

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.730
but they carry good medicines.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:47.480
You should go there.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:50.620
Very well. I shall.

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.190
Well, then,

00:20:56.190 --> 00:21:00.630
this is farewell, Mr. Abeno and Mr. Ashiya.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:05.820
Farewell.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.280
I'm glad we exorcised it.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:26.250
Though all I did was scream 
off on the sidelines...

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:28.010
That's not true.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:28.850
Huh?

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:33.020
You made the yokai ask to be exorcised.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.600
If you hadn't said anything,

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:40.310
I wouldn't have even given 
the yokai that option.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:45.210
<i>Because I was afraid of 
giving it that medicine.</i>

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:49.770
Huh?

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:53.000
Abeno-san?!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time: "Zenko"</b>

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:30.120
Exorcising yokai is hard work.

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.590
I hope I can do a good job.

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.640
Don't worry. I don't expect 
anything from you at all.

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.310
Don't you think that's mean?
